{"type":"Film","id":"ES2016_057","slug":"es2016-057-joana-biarnes-una-entre-tots","title":{"native":"Joana Biarnés, una entre tots","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-04-03","year":2016},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Òscar Moreno","slug":"oscar-moreno","name":"Òscar Moreno","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},{"id":"Jordi Rovira","slug":"jordi-rovira","name":"Jordi Rovira","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode","Biopic"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5492828/mediaviewer/rm345780992/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SsWUEV6qXuU"},"synopsis":{"native":"Se coló en la suite de los Beatles, engañó a Roman Polanski, fue fotógrafa de Raphael, escogió el vestido de Massiel para Eurovisión, Clint Eastwood besó sus labios. Fue amiga de Xavier Cugat, Joan Manuel Serrat, la Duquesa de Alba, Fernando Rey, el Cordobés, Lola Flores, Salvador Dalí... Esta es la desconocida vida y obra de Joana Biarnés, la primera fotoperiodista española, recuperada gracias al descubrimiento ya en el siglo XXI de las impresionantes imágenes con las que la entonces joven fotógrafa inmortalizó las terribles inundaciones del Vallés en 1962. Una pionera que venció los prejuicios de una época, triunfó en la profesión, conoció e inmortalizó a grandes personajes de la historia y, cuando se pudo convertir en leyenda, desapareció.","english":"She spent three hours in the suite of the Beatles, tricked Roman Polanski under a false identity, was staff photographer of the artist Raphael, chose the dress of Massiel for Eurovision, blushed when Clint Eastwood kissed her. She was a close friend of Xavier Cugat, Fernando Rey, Joan Manuel Serrat, the Duchess of Alba, the Cordobés, Lola Flores, Salvador Dali ... This is the untold story of Juanita Biarnés, the first woman in Spain that worked as photojournalist. A pioneer who overcame the prejudices of his time, that triumphed in her job, who immortalized the great figures of history and, when he could have become a legend, disappeared."},"production":[{"country":"Spain","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Carmen Rigalt","slug":"carmen-rigalt","name":"Carmen Rigalt","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Gervasio Sánchez","slug":"gervasio-sanchez","name":"Gervasio Sánchez","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Jean Michel Bamberger","slug":"jean-michel-bamberger","name":"Jean Michel Bamberger","birthYear":1940,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Joan Manuel Serrat","slug":"joan-manuel-serrat","name":"Joan Manuel Serrat","birthYear":1943,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Joana Biarnés","slug":"joana-biarnes","name":"Joana Biarnés","birthYear":1935,"deathYear":2018,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Jordi Rovira","slug":"jordi-rovira","name":"Jordi Rovira","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Josep Maria Pou","slug":"josep-maria-pou","name":"Josep Maria Pou","birthYear":1944,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Juan Mari Arzak","slug":"juan-mari-arzak","name":"Juan Mari Arzak","birthYear":1942,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person